Comment:
@koha12 It's so fuckin easy to learn. It just takes SOME time. When I picked it up I was confused for like a game or two, but it's so quick. Because the system is genious. R is always defensive. Space is always a movement skill Q is always a special effect thing E varies M1 is a weaker fast attack M2 is a heavier attack or attack modifier.

That's for all champions. And it's not a hard system. It's not meant to be played like DotA is. It does make sense. 

And you can change the controls anyway.

